==English==

===Etymology===
From Mandarin Chinese rénshēn (simplified: [[人参]]; traditional: [[人參]]) 

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''ginseng'''

# any of several [[plant]]s, of the [[genus]] ''[[Panax]]'', having [[forked]] [[root]]s supposed to have [[medicinal]] properties
# the roots of these plants; [[extract]]s of these roots

